\f0\b0 \cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 And this doesn't require making the days into independent blocks or partitioning the physical world along midnight boundaries.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 The day remains an observer-defined chart over ongoing activity.\cf0 \cb1 \
