\f10\b\fs48 5. The tensions I would now consider provisionally resolved\cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f9\b0\fs24 \cf2 \cb5 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f0\fs28 We no longer need to decide whether the system is fundamentally a livestream archive, a Git repository, a Hugging Face dataset, a Transformer training corpus, a temporal graph, or an eventual embodied intelligence architecture.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 Those are different interfaces and operations over a developing system.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 Nor do we need to choose between local QKV training and a globally recursive theory of integration. The former can provide trainable observations; the latter can investigate how those observations and learning processes relate across time.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 The boundary worth preserving is between three kinds of claim:\cf0 \cb1 \

\f1\b \cf2 \cb5 What was represented. What was inferred. What was causally demonstrated.
\f0\b0 \cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 And the symbol system\'97
\f6\fs33\fsmilli16940 \cf0 \cb1 \strokec2 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f7 \cf2 \cb5 \uc0\u934 \cf0 \cb1 \

\f6 \cf2 \cb5 \uc0\u934 
\f0\fs28 \cf2 \cb5 \strokec2 , 
